OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday, dense fog may linger
OL,6,Finto the late morning in prone
OL,7,Flocations. Lifting elsewhere, allowing
OL,8,Ffor brief sunshine before a band of
OL,9,Flow cloud sinks south and eastwards,
OL,10,Fbringing with it outbreaks of light
OL,11,Frain and drizzle.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSkies will turn clearer
OL,14,Fthroughout this evening, allowing
OL,15,Ftemperatures to drop away. Remaining
OL,16,Fdry but feeling rather chilly under
OL,17,Flight northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
