OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA bright start on Monday.
OL,6,FBecoming slightly cloudier from the
OL,7,Feast through the day, though sunny
OL,8,Fspells will persist and it will remain
OL,9,Fdry. Feeling fresher in a northerly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FRemaining largely dry and fine through
OL,14,Fthe period with high pressure
OL,15,Fdominating. Plenty of sunny spells on
OL,16,Foffer, yet with the risk of the odd
OL,17,Flight shower where cloud thickens.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
